35,0$ a. (34) Growth rate 14-30 mm. Advancing zone raised to appressed, even, hyphae rather distant to distant. Marginal hyphae 1.5-3.5(-4.5) µm wide, sometimes with densely branched laterals. Aerial hyphae 2-4.5 µm wide, thin- to firm-walled. Chlamydospores globose to broadly ellipsoid, 13-19 x 10-15 µm. S.-America. /// Code: (8), (9), (11), 13, (14), 17, 22, (24), 30, 31, 39, 42, (44), 45, 52, 53, (61), 83, 85, 89. $ Trametes feei (Fr.) Pat. 
